    "description": "Ad-Sol Nissin Corporation develops information and embedded systems for companies in Japan. The company provides IoT products and solutions, including proprietary electric field communication devices; SUNMAP, a geographic information system (GIS) solution for the effective use of customer information assets; provide one-stop security enhancement support services. It also offers wireless communications, cloud technology, and development support services. The company is also involved in development and operation management of systems in social infrastructure fields, including energy sectors such as electricity and gas as well as automobiles, roads, railway, air transport disaster prevention, information communications, and payment services. Ad-Sol Nissin Corporation was founded in 1976 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan."
